# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own token — .env is already
# gitignored, so it never gets committed.
#
# 1. Create a token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens (a "Read"
#    token is enough).
# 2. Open https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-3-1b-it and accept the
#    license — the token above only works once your account has access.
#
# If you'd rather not manage a .env file, run `huggingface-cli login` (or
# `hf auth login`) once instead; the scripts fall back to that cached login
# automatically when HF_TOKEN is unset.
HF_TOKEN=
